# methoxyacetic acid  pKa=3.570
# Source: NIST
# Alpha-OMe: ED donor through space but mild EW inductive via O lone pairs.
# pKa=3.57 tests the -I effect of O without the -M resonance available in
# aromatic systems. Sits between acetic (4.76) and chloroacetic (2.87).

